body: "# MCP Tools Curated Set v1.0 — Plano de Implementação\n\n> **Status**: W0 (Planning) COMPLETO — aprovado por Gabriel\n> **Data**: 2026-06-06\n> **DAG nativo**: `task_1780763041476850005` (17 subtasks, 0 ciclos, valid=true)\n> **Autoridade**: Touring Agentic Code Orchestration (TACO) | **CILA Level**: L4+ (refactor arquitetural multi-crate)\n\n---\n\n## §1. Resumo Executivo (TL;DR)\n\n**Problema**: 102 MCP tools expostas via `touring serve` (MCP server) consomem muita janela de contexto e falham com frequência.\n\n**Análise (FASE 1 SCOUT)**:\n- **36/102 (35%)** duplicam CLI 1:1 (ast, tantivy, entity, wiring)\n- **32/102 (31%)** são wave-labeled T1/T2/T3 — envelopes aspiracionais Wave 5/6/7\n- **33/102** são da família `ctx_*` — 32 dos quais T-labeled\n- **21/102** são da família `generator_*` — únicos ao MCP mas sub-utilizados\n\n**Solução aprovada**:\n- **Reduzir para 22 tools** (19 mantidas + 3 novas) — **78% de redução**\n- **Fundir 9 `*_status` tools** em 1 com enum `family` (FamilyRouter pattern)\n- **Adicionar 3 novas**: `touring_tdg`, `touring_hook_metrics`, `touring_cortex_classify`\n- **Migration path**: tools removidas ganham `#[deprecated(note=\"use CLI: touring <sub>\")]` — 30 dias de coexistência\n- **CLI intacto**: 102 subcommands continuam acessíveis via `touring <sub>` (zero regressão de superfície CLI)\n\n**Investimento**: 4 waves, 5-8 dias engenheiro.\n\n---\n\n## §2. Conjunto Curado (19 + 3 = 22 tools)\n\n### Categoria A — CORE WORKFLOW (5 tools — caminho crítico diário)\n\n| # | Tool | Função | Categoria Decision Matrix |\n|---|------|--------|---------------------------|\n| 1 | `touring_ast_meta` | File metadata first (blast_radius, quality, cognitive) | C01, C04 |\n| 2 | `touring_ast_find` | Symbol lookup (VGP gate) | C03 |\n| 3 | `touring_tantivy_search` | Full-text BM25 search | C01, C02 |\n| 4 | `touring_memory_recall` | Knowledge graph FTS5 + cosine | C01, C09 |\n| 5 | `touring_wiring_audit` | Pub-symbol tracking (REGRA #0) | C04, C10 |\n\n### Categoria B — WRITES (3 tools — state mutation)\n\n| # | Tool | Função | Categoria Decision Matrix |\n|---|------|--------|---------------------------|\n| 6 | `touring_memory_store` | Persistir lesson/pattern | C10 |\n| 7 | `touring_source_change` | Transactional file apply | C05, C06 |\n| 8 | `touring_decompose` | DAG task management | C10 |\n\n### Categoria C — DIAGNOSTICS (4 tools — system health consolidado)\n\n| # | Tool | Função | Categoria Decision Matrix |\n|---|------|--------|---------------------------|\n| 9 | `touring_status` (REFATORADO) | Composite dashboard + family enum | C12 |\n| 10 | `touring_gate_metrics` | Counter snapshot (rl, ceg, enrichment) | C12 |\n| 11 | `touring_drift` | Evolution drift detection | C12 |\n| 12 | `touring_quality_signal_compute` | Sentrux 0..10000 + bottleneck | C12 |\n\n### Categoria D — CONTEXT EFFICIENCY (2 tools — token saving)\n\n| # | Tool | Função | Categoria Decision Matrix |\n|---|------|--------|---------------------------|\n| 13 | `touring_ctx_smart` | 2-line file summary (<50ms) | C02 |\n| 14 | `touring_ctx_explain` | Counter explainer | C12 |\n\n### Categoria E — WORKFLOW PRIMITIVES (3 tools — orchestrator essentials)\n\n| # | Tool | Função | Categoria Decision Matrix |\n|---|------|--------|---------------------------|\n| 15 | `touring_session` | Lifecycle (start/checkpoint/assess) | C10 |\n| 16 | `touring_checkpoint` | Durable state file | C10 |\n| 17 | `touring_minimal_context` | Compact tool listing | C01 |\n\n### Categoria F — ADVANCED (2 tools — codegen pipeline)\n\n| # | Tool | Função | Categoria Decision Matrix |\n|---|------|--------|---------------------------|\n| 18 | `touring_generator_validate_plan` | Plan schema validation | C07 |\n| 19 | `touring_generator_speculate_plan` | Shadow validation pre-commit | C07 |\n\n### Categoria G — NOVAS (3 tools — gaps identificados)\n\n| # | Tool | Função | Categoria Decision Matrix |\n|---|------|--------|---------------------------|\n| 20 | `touring_tdg` (NOVO) | Grade letter A+..F wrapper sobre `touring ast tdg` | C04, C06 |\n| 21 | `touring_hook_metrics` (NOVO) | Hook dispatch p50/p99 latency agregado | C12 |\n| 22 | `touring_cortex_classify` (NOVO) | Unified intent classification (CILA L0-L6) | C01 |\n\n---\n\n## §3. O que REMOVER (83 tools)\n\n| Categoria | Qtd | Ação | Justificativa |\n|----------|---:|------|---------------|\n| Wave-labeled T1/T2/T3 | 32 | Remover do MCP, manter CLI | Aspiracional, falha frequente |\n| `touring_tantivy_*` (exceto search) | 4 | Remover do MCP, manter CLI | Duplicam `touring tantivy` |\n| `touring_entity_*` | 5 | Remover do MCP, manter CLI | Duplicam `touring entity` |\n| `touring_wiring_*` (exceto audit) | 2 | Remover do MCP, manter CLI | Duplicam `touring wiring` |\n| `touring_generator_*` (exceto validate/speculate) | 19 | Remover do MCP, manter CLI | Sub-utilizados |\n| `touring_ctx_*_status` (lsp/otlp/graphql/cloud/shared/web) | 6 | Fundir em `touring_status(family=\"integration\")` | Redundantes |\n| Outros misc (activity_replay, etc) | 15 | Remover do MCP, manter CLI | Baixo uso |\n\n---\n\n## §4. FamilyRouter — Fusão de 9 `*_status` em 1\n\n### Pattern\n\n```rust\n// Em tools_quality_signal.rs (ou novo tools_status.rs)\n#[derive(Deserialize, JsonSchema)]\npub enum StatusFamily {\n    Health,        // touring_doctor\n    Integration,   // lsp, otlp, graphql, cloud, shared, web (6 → 1)\n    Evolution,     // touring_drift + evolution_drift\n    Wiring,        // pub-symbol state\n    Memory,        // knowledge graph stats\n    Ast,           // ast index health\n}\n\n#[derive(Deserialize, JsonSchema)]\npub struct StatusInput {\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub family: Option<StatusFamily>,  // None = composite dashboard\n}\n\n#[tool(name = \"touring_status\", description = \"...\")]\npub async fn touring_status(&self, params: Parameters<StatusInput>) -> Result<CallToolResult, McpError> {\n    let family = params.0.family;\n    match family {\n        None => self.status_composite().await,        // default = full dashboard\n        Some(StatusFamily::Health) => self.doctor_async().await,\n        Some(StatusFamily::Integration) => self.status_integration_aggregated().await,  // merges 6\n        Some(StatusFamily::Evolution) => self.evolution_drift_async().await,\n        // ...\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Substituições\n- `touring_lsp_status` → `touring_status(family=\"integration\", subsystem=\"lsp\")` (subsystem opcional)\n- `touring_otlp_status` → `touring_status(family=\"integration\", subsystem=\"otlp\")`\n- `touring_graphql_status` → `touring_status(family=\"integration\", subsystem=\"graphql\")`\n- `touring_cloud_sync_status` → `touring_status(family=\"integration\", subsystem=\"cloud\")`\n- `touring_shared_cache_status` → `touring_status(family=\"integration\", subsystem=\"cache\")`\n- `touring_web_status` → `touring_status(family=\"integration\", subsystem=\"web\")`\n\n---\n\n## §5. Wave Breakdown\n\n### W1: FOUNDATION (1-2 dias) — 4 subtasks\n- **W1.1** Identificar 19 tools a manter (gate com `#[cfg(feature=\"mcp-server\")]`)\n- **W1.2** Implementar `touring_status(family: enum)` consolidando 9 status tools\n- **W1.3** Adicionar `#[cfg(feature=\"mcp-server\")]` gating em todos impl blocks\n- **W1.4** Validar com cargo check + clippy + tour doctor\n\n### W2: NEW TOOLS (2-3 dias) — 4 subtasks\n- **W2.1** `touring_tdg` — wrapper MCP para `touring ast tdg` CLI\n- **W2.2** `touring_hook_metrics` — hook dispatch p50/p99 latency\n- **W2.3** `touring_cortex_classify` — unified intent classification\n- **W2.4** cargo test + integration tests\n\n### W3: MIGRATION PATH (1-2 dias) — 3 subtasks\n- **W3.1** Adicionar `#[deprecated(note=\"use CLI: touring <sub>\")]` em 83 tools removidas\n- **W3.2** Script auto-detect: scan `~/.claude/projects/*.jsonl` para uso\n- **W3.3** Migration guide em `rust/docs/2026-06-06-mcp-curated-migration.md`\n\n### W4: AUDIT + DOCS (1-2 dias) — 4 subtasks\n- **W4.1** Cross-audit: 19+3 tools funcionam, 83 deprecated retornam erro informativo\n- **W4.2** Atualizar `mcp_tools.md` e Touring skill master\n- **W4.3** TOON checkpoint com decisões e métricas\n- **W4.4** tour e2e + composite_health_score gate\n\n**Total**: 5-8 dias engenheiro (4 waves × 1-2 dias cada, com paralelização intra-wave).\n\n---\n\n## §6. Critérios de Validação (Quality Gates)\n\n| Gate | Comando | Critério |\n|------|---------|----------|\n| Compilation | `cargo check --workspace` | exit 0, 0 errors |\n| Lint | `cargo clippy --workspace -- -D warnings` | 0 warnings |\n| Tests | `cargo test --workspace` | 0 fails |\n| Functional | Cada um dos 22 tools retorna dados válidos | manual + integration test |\n| Wiring | `touring wiring orphans` | sem novos orphans |\n| Health | `touring e2e` | composite_score ≥ 0.7 (atual 0.69) |\n| Coverage | C01-C12 Decision Matrix | 100% |\n\n---\n\n## §7. Risk Mitigation\n\n| Risco | Mitigation |\n|-------|-----------|\n| Tools removidas quebram usuários externos | 30 dias de deprecation warning; CLI intacto |\n| FamilyRouter muda contrato | Manter 6 tools `*_status` originais como aliases finos por 30 dias |\n| Migration guide incompleto | Auto-detect script (W3.2) identifica uso real antes de remover |\n| Performance regression | 22 tools vs 102 = -78% tool count; latência individual ≤ 200ms |\n\n---\n\n## §8. Métricas de Sucesso\n\n| Métrica | Baseline | Target |\n|---------|----------|--------|\n| MCP tool count | 102 | 22 (-78%) |\n| Wave-labeled (aspiracional) | 32 | 0 (-100%) |\n| CLI-duplicate tools | 36 | 0 (-100%) |\n| `*_status` family | 9 | 1 (-89%) |\n| Token cost per session (estimado) | TBD | -60% (A/B test post-deploy) |\n| Failure rate (sample 100 calls) | TBD | <5% (vs atual ~25%) |\n| Coverage C01-C12 | 100% | 100% (mantido) |\n\n---\n\n## §9. Decisões Arquiteturais (DA-001..DA-005)\n\n- **DA-001**: FamilyRouter pattern para 9 `*_status` (vs manter separados) — Gabriel aprovou fusão\n- **DA-002**: 19+3 tools (vs 15 ou 30) — Gabriel aprovou conjunto curado\n- **DA-003**: Incluir 3 novas tools (tdg, hook_metrics, cortex_classify) — Gabriel aprovou\n- **DA-004**: Migration path com 30 dias de deprecation — não breaking\n- **DA-005**: `#[cfg(feature=\"mcp-server\")]` gating — preserva CLI, remove só exposição MCP\n\n---\n\n## §10. Próximos Passos\n\n1. **AGUARDAR Aprovação Final** deste plano\n2. **AGUARDAR decisão**: começar W1 imediatamente ou agendar para outra sessão?\n3. **Pré-requisito operacional**: `taco-forge doctor` confirma ferramentas no PATH (já validado FASE 0)\n4. **Communication**: usar `touring memory store` + `touring learning reward` ao final de cada wave\n\n---\n\n## §11. Apêndice A — Catálogo Completo (102 tools)\n\nVer `~/.claude/projects/-home-gabrielgadea/6504ecee-5fea-4879-ab46-2c34fc0a7882/tool-results/.../mcp_tool_catalog.json` (gerado via `analyze_mcp_tools.py` em FASE 1).\n\n## §12. Apêndice B — Análise de Redundância\n\nVer `~/.claude/projects/-home-gabrielgadea/6504ecee-5fea-4879-ab46-2c34fc0a7882/tool-results/.../redundancy_analysis.py` (gerado em FASE 1).\n\n---\n\n**Checkpoint**: TACO W0 (planning) COMPLETO. Próximo gate: Aprovação Gabriel para início W1.\n\n*Plano gerado em modo TACO L4+ — Sequential Phase Protocol v6.2 — FASE 4 DECOMPOSE*\n"
